# Short 5, "The Chord page" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): Steppers playing (saw stabs), ENV for the
# Chord page, Stabs up and Decay longer (slow turns, single steps, from a bar's downbeat); then ALGORITHM through
# the voices in the Thin phrase (bars 16-23: no bass, no shaker, the chord exposed): Keys, Organ, Bell,
# Tonewheel; Saws again as the phrase turns Full, and Cutoff shut, opened, and back to the recipe.
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for the labels).
turn PRESET 2 5
wait 30
expect piece 2
bar 8
wav 14-short-chord.wav
film 14-short-chord.film
bar 8 STEPPERS playing (D Dorian, 126)
bar 10 ENV: the Chord page
tap ENV
bar 11 KNOB 2, Stabs 45 up to 75: more a bar
turn K2 30 50
expect par28 75
bar 13 KNOB 3, Decay 25 up to 65: longer
turn K3 40 50
expect par13 65
bar 16 the Thin phrase; ALGORITHM: the voice Keys
turn ALGO 1 300
expect par22 1
bar 18 Organ
turn ALGO 1 300
expect par22 2
bar 20 Bell
turn ALGO 2 300
expect par22 4
bar 22 Tonewheel
turn ALGO 1 300
expect par22 5
bar 24 Full again; Saws again
turn ALGO 2 150
expect par22 0
bar 25 KNOB 4, Cutoff 55 down to 15: dark
turn K4 -40 50
expect par12 15
bar 27 Cutoff 15 up to 85: open
turn K4 70 50
expect par12 85
bar 29 Cutoff back to 55
turn K4 -30 50
expect par12 55
bar 32 END
filmstop
wavstop
